            "speaker_id": 84286,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "The schedule in A8 seems a bit slow. Why don't we just do it all next Sunday? Rip the band-aid off.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 55101,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "I'd advise against that. A 'big bang' rollout makes it impossible to trace stock movement accurately and the risk of misplacing something critical is too high. The phased approach in A8 is much safer.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
